{
  "id": "great_sensible_heat_factor___gshf",
  "title": "Great Sensible Heat Factor - GSHF",
  "description": "Calculator for Great Sensible Heat Factor (GSHF), which determines the capacity of a cooling coil to handle sensible heat load and cool fresh make-up air. GSHF is independent of total air flow and is calculated from sensible/total heat generation, fresh air mass flow, specific heat, temperatures, and specific enthalpies.",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Great Sensible Heat Factor - GSHF\n\nThe Great Sensible Heat Factor represents the ratio of sensible cooling capacity to total cooling capacity and is calculated using:\n\n**GSHF = (Qs + mf × cp × (tf - tr)) / (Qt + mf × (hf - hr))**\n\n### Where:\n- **Qs** = Sensible heat generated in the room (kW)\n- **Qt** = Total heat generated in the room (kW)\n- **mf** = Fresh air mass flow - make up air (kg/s)\n- **cp** = Specific heat of air (kJ/kg°C)\n- **tf** = Temperature in fresh air (°C)\n- **tr** = Temperature in room air (°C)\n- **hf** = Specific enthalpy of fresh air (kJ/kg)\n- **hr** = Specific enthalpy of air in the room (kJ/kg)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "sensible_heat_qs",
          "label": "Sensible Heat (Qs)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kW",
          "defaultValue": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "total_heat_qt",
          "label": "Total Heat (Qt)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kW",
          "defaultValue": 5.4
        },
        {
          "id": "fresh_air_mass_flow",
          "label": "Fresh Air Mass Flow (mf)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg/s",
          "defaultValue": 0.278
        },
        {
          "id": "specific_heat_cp",
          "label": "Specific Heat of Air (cp)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kJ/kg°C",
          "defaultValue": 1.005
        },
        {
          "id": "fresh_air_temp_tf",
          "label": "Fresh Air Temperature (tf)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 28
        },
        {
          "id": "room_air_temp_tr",
          "label": "Room Air Temperature (tr)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 22
        },
        {
          "id": "fresh_air_enthalpy_hf",
          "label": "Fresh Air Specific Enthalpy (hf)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kJ/kg",
          "defaultValue": 60
        },
        {
          "id": "room_air_enthalpy_hr",
          "label": "Room Air Specific Enthalpy (hr)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kJ/kg",
          "defaultValue": 45
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "numerator",
          "label": "Numerator (Qs + mf × cp × (tf - tr))",
          "formula": "inputs.sensible_heat_qs + inputs.fresh_air_mass_flow * inputs.specific_heat_cp * (inputs.fresh_air_temp_tf - inputs.room_air_temp_tr)",
          "unit": "kW",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "denominator",
          "label": "Denominator (Qt + mf × (hf - hr))",
          "formula": "inputs.total_heat_qt + inputs.fresh_air_mass_flow * (inputs.fresh_air_enthalpy_hf - inputs.room_air_enthalpy_hr)",
          "unit": "kW",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "gshf",
          "label": "Great Sensible Heat Factor (GSHF)",
          "formula": "(inputs.sensible_heat_qs + inputs.fresh_air_mass_flow * inputs.specific_heat_cp * (inputs.fresh_air_temp_tf - inputs.room_air_temp_tr)) / (inputs.total_heat_qt + inputs.fresh_air_mass_flow * (inputs.fresh_air_enthalpy_hf - inputs.room_air_enthalpy_hr))",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chart",
